    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>1级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 自然界 类人生物（鳞爪类）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 29；''重伤'' 14</span><span>''先攻'' +5</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 15，''强韧'' 12，''反射'' 14，''意志'' 12</span><span>''侦查'' +1</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}短剑（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+6vs.AC<br>命中：1d6+3 伤害，该狗头人在其回合开始之后每快步过一格该攻击造成 2 点额外伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">移动动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">疾驰步伐✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该狗头人快步最多三格。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">狡诈✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该狗头人快步一格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+4，隐秘+8</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 8（-1）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+3）</span><span>''感知'' 13（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 13（+1）</span><span>''智力'' 9（-1）</span><span>''魅力'' 10（+0）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，龙语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，轻盾，短剑</span></div></div>\n</div>",
